   "tender": {
    "id": "CF-3717300D0O000000rwimUAA",
    "title": "Services for HR Leaders (Gartner)",
    "description": "UKHSA is currently undertaking a workforce transformation to support the new strategic direction of the org post COVID-19. This transformation focuses on the enhancement of organisational capabilities to be agile/adaptive to respond to new emerging health threats across the UK alongside right sizing back-office functions to drive efficiency.\r\n\r\nAs a strategic professional services advisor Gartner will support this workforce transformation by strengthening the people function as they move from transactional to strategic, building essential skills/competencies across the org and creating a new cultural identity built on high performance.\r\n\r\nGartner provide strategic partnership with executive-level advisory, cross-enterprise alignment, and board-ready insights which will help accelerate the workforce transformation ongoing at UKHSA. We simplify complexity, pressure-test plans, and enable purpose-driven change-ensuring long-term success for both the HR function and the wider organisation. They will provide expertise services and network-driven insight on best-practice HR solution, tailored support for critical priorities, Exclusive HR leadership meetings and provide expert advice on major initiatives and access to tools, diagnostics and research to help execute against mission-critical prioritie including HR Strategy, Organisational Culture, Strategic Workforce Planning, HR Operating Model, HR Talent and reduction in HR Cost and Budget.",
